<title>USA: Zale Q1 same-store sales up 4.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Zale Q1 same-store sales up 4.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zale Corp said on Thursday that fiscal first quarter comparable-store sales increased four percent from the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Zale said first quarter sales totaled $230.8 million, up from $214.3 million a year ago. The fiscal 1997 first quarter ended October 31.</p>
<p>Zale operates about 1,200 jewelry stores and leased departments in the United States, Guam and Puerto Rico.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
